<title>USA: Port conditions update - United States - Lloyds.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - United States - Lloyds.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>OAKLAND, Nov 4 - Skilled longshore labour, clerks and equipment drivers in go-slow or work stoppage in San Francisco Bay area at random selected docks/piers, disrupting operations.</p>
<p>Unknown how long disruption will continue.</p>
</text>
